<title>NEW ZEALAND: RUGBY UNION-HIGHLANDERS BEAT N.TRANSVAAL IN NZ SUPER 12.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-HIGHLANDERS BEAT N.TRANSVAAL IN NZ SUPER 12.</headline>
<dateline>DUNEDIN, New Zealand 1997-03-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Otago Highlanders beat the Northern Transvaal Blue Bulls 27-7 (halftime 19-7) in a Super 12 rugby match in Dunedin on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Otago Highlanders - Tries: Pailate Fili, Jeff Wilson. Conversions: Simon Culhane. Penalties: Simon Culhane (5).</p>
<p>Northern Transvaal - Tries: Ruben Kruger. Conversions: Dirkie Nortje.</p>
